# The leaks of a felt emotion on an own head close up (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/face-cues.md, step 4 of its
# order): for each felt mood and half of the face of the profile's leaks a frame without it and a frame at its apex
# (0.18 s: the rise and half the hold), leak-<felt>-<half>-rest.png and leak-<felt>-<half>-apex.png. Blinks are off,
# the liar's too, so no frame catches the lids. Needs an own head with leaks in its face profile:
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1280x720 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content root> BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/face-leaks.bench
# The sheet of the frames: reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/cues/engine_sheet.py <bench out dir> <sheet.jpg>
